// Sites with an ID and without one: a line, an option, a call and a block. A missing ID gets a fallback.

== snap.ids
mira: Written ID. #id:first_line
mira: No ID.
-> Written option #id:option_one
    @end
-> Option with no ID
@call snap.ids #id:the_call
@call snap.ids
@sequence #id:seq_block
    - mira: A.
    - mira: B.
@once
    mira: C.
